Z||000000||btoth||03-26-2001||05:55 PM||||Well, I ordered my Flowmaster muffler from them on the 19th because I got sick of waiting on hold when I called Flowmaster directly.  Well, every couple days I get generic emails saying "thanks for being patient.. blah, blah, blah... we expect to ship your item by 4/10/01...".  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> What the hell?  My friend ordered generic parts for his car and they came in two days.  Is this how they always are with aftermarket parts?||||reg||8
