Z||000005||Cooter||03-26-2001||08:41 PM||||Yes on what Rockcrawl said. Summit sent my parts by FedEx and it arrived on a saturday, just 2 days after I ordered for no extra charge! My Carparts.com horror story is that out of several hundred dollars of parts, it took over a month to start getting them and only about $25 worth of stuff was right.||||reg||1
